From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Mattia <mattiapearl@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 17 Aug 2026 17:41:57 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] Add process-wide fluid tick budget

Adapted from PaperMC/Folia PR #503. Folia's per-region fluid limits multiply
with independently active regions. Add an optional process-wide 50ms budget so
fluid floods cannot consume the full local allowance in every region at once.
Work is delayed, never discarded. Configuration lives in this fork's folia.yml.


